<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan one-month NCDs average yield at 5.90 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan one-month NCDs average yield at 5.90 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank issued T$8 billion in one-month negotiable certificates of deposit on Tuesday at an average yield of 5.90 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>Bids ranged between 5.75 and 6.00 percent.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$13.75 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
